## 3. Concrete Improvement Architecture: The "Proxy-First 5-View Loop"

Instead of iterating 9 blind image-generation retries on pure prose prompts, transform V5 isolation into a **3-step deterministic geometric loop**:

| Step | Action | Output / Gate | Expected Effect on Retry Count |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Stage 1: Single-View CMY + Normal Proxy** | Run **Marigold Normals** (or V5 CMY 1-view wrap) + coarse `CMY` symmetric/asymmetric 3D blockout directly from `front` (`master.png` / `ref_cut.png`) in `< 3 seconds`. | Coarse 3D proxy mesh (`proxy_blockout.obj`) in Houdini/Mitsuba. | Replaces pure textual guesswork with explicit 3D volume. |
| **Stage 2: Render Locked Canonical 5-View Blueprint Guides** | Project `proxy_blockout.obj` through the 5 exact orthographic cameras (`front`, `back`, `left`, `top`, `bottom`) + subtle normal map tint + clean RGB axis gimbal + neighbor ghost hulls (dimmed). | 1 stitched `proxy_guide_2x2.png` (or 5 view guides + exact `RefFrame` boxes). | Forces true `90 deg` orthographic framing, exact height alignment, and non-overlapping back/top views. |
| **Stage 3: Conditioned Re-Detailing + Pixel Gate** | Pass `(ref_cut.png, proxy_guide.png)` to Gemini/ChatGPT Image: keep proxy silhouette & orthographic axes fixed, transfer surface bevels, creases, slots, and back details. Immediately run V5 `RefFrame` + `Cameras` + **Mask-vs-Proxy IoU Gate** before saving `returned/`. | Verified 5-view ortho kit (`V7_cross < 2 px` disagreement). | Drops isolation attempts from `9` tries down to `1 to 2` tries. |

### Extension to Organic (Characters & Trees)
- **Characters**: Fit an anatomical parametric mannequin cage (`ZrlBodyNet` / Houdini KineFX proxy skeleton derived from 2D joint keypoints) -> render ortho Depth/Silhouette guides for `front / back / left / top / 3-4` -> condition image generator so limb proportions, head angle, and shoulder width stay identical to `< 1%` across all views (`Manny` & `Dracard`).
- **Trees**: First generate/clean **leafless structural pass** ("winter branch structure, matte grey bark on flat grey background") across 4 ortho views so `BranchLab` Sato ridges see 100% of primary/secondary boughs, then generate **canopy foliage clusters + leaf card alpha sheets** separately!

